5,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I worry about timetables breaking when external conditions shift.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"We keep judging new ideas by how they sound, ignoring past records.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,Staff absorb new commitments without checking if the skills exist on the roster.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,"Budgets look fine at the vote, but thin by year two.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Where buildings sit and when they open decides who can reach us.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, do the old records show which conditions caused the failures?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, yes. I want to see what was tried and left unexamined.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Minako, if the funding shape is the issue, we need to check the terms.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, exactly. The structure matters more than the total amount.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I am concerned about access for those in the outer wards.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I will look at the winter road closures north of the river.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will check the two programmes begun six years ago.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will review the volunteer register and supervision training.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will examine the county grant terms and the endowment.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will check the bus links in the two outer wards.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I will also look at the attendance sheets from former outreach stops.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I will also look at the running and equipment lines last year.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shion,,I will also look at the neighbourhood associations and tool certification.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Minako,,I will also look at the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
