35,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"The road closures shut for eleven days, but community halls kept their timetables.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The digitisation batch left half its images unindexed. The partner groups still meet.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shion,,"A dozen retired tradespeople run the repair clinic, but no one is trained to supervise.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The grant pays session fees for twelve months only, then the operating budget takes over.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,Two outer wards lost their bus link. Residents face an hour's round trip now.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, so the partner-run groups are more stable than the internal digitisation?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, yes. The internal project stalled, but the external partners persist.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Minako, if the grant lapses, the operating budget absorbs the cost. That is a trap.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, correct. The funding shape creates a cliff edge after year one.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Yumi, the community halls worked because they were local. We need to be local too.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Yumi,,The attendance sheets show forty visitors per session in the outer wards.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,The vehicle running line overran by a third. The equipment allocation closed under budget.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shion,,The technician who kept the power tools certified retired in spring.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Minako,,"Evening room bookings are full, but remote catalogue use peaks after nine.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,The scanning contractors slip when larger clients book first. Bench tooling ships in weeks.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Yumi,,"@Daisuke, so the mobile service might face delivery delays?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Shion, agreed. The equipment was fine, but the running costs were not.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, the vehicle overrun is a warning. We need to avoid heavy logistics.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Minako,,"The remote use suggests we need digital access, not just physical presence.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@Yumi, yes. The scanning is risky, but the tooling is fast.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
